{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "baea52c2de6812afe7e711e6c28c3be4a773df0fe0ee9b310aed33cd47875d5f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　こんにちは！\nこんなところで会えるなんて、ミラクルですね！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！你好！\n没想到能在这种地方遇见，真是奇迹呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9bf819609e4eaee1700087e5346f819671e338125a74a1c98180f37e3a48b079", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\nそれより、麗花。今日はオフじゃなかったか？", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。\n不过，丽花，你今天不是休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "5366b250147dedaf9e4e7e2d10d7e3e1d93a0ea1822e5f790965e6668a448271", "ja": "はい！　お休みだったんで衣替えに挑戦してたんです。\nそしたら、お気に入りの服と目が合っちゃって。", "zh": "是的！因为今天休息，所以我正在挑战换季整理衣物。\n结果，和我最喜欢的衣服对上眼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "6bf9e2ef96e3b2538f99e9f8fe820e41cb6ddabb39a067a5c38656bc4ddb8784", "ja": "お出かけしたいなーと思って、ルンルンしてたら、\n{$P$}さんに会えました！", "zh": "我正想着出去逛逛，心情雀跃地走着走着，就遇到了{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6327866c5e622039bc635edb433fc1cceee92849738dbf3edb732feab70370e7", "ja": "な、なるほど？　つまり、ぶらぶら歩いてきたら\nいつの間にか劇場に来てた……ってことかな。", "zh": "原、原来如此？也就是说，随便逛着逛着，不知不觉就来到剧场了……是这个意思吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bc0b60fc081e0869c2995988e8c5025b5f28592f27ffbba1297a56f8edfcf644", "ja": "（お散歩にしては、かなりの距離のはずだが……）", "zh": "（要说是散步，这距离应该相当远了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed83fb1bdb654feb7e7a66959903210a317176e1ea06735379e781371929d07e", "ja": "ところで{$P$}さん！\nこの服、どう思いますか？　ちゃんと初夏ってますか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生！\n你觉得这身衣服怎么样？是不是很有初夏的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d23681bf6d2338aae354e1465b8a248b76f8ace8b6d8236dd97dee686c4ae3f8", "ja": "初夏……？　ああ、そうだな。\n涼しげでとても夏らしい感じがして可愛いと思うよ。", "zh": "初夏……？啊，确实是这样。\n看起来清爽，很有夏日气息，我觉得很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "bcdfa0e0f16a3558d3bee00eeae37ec1d2f934245ad5a3be0ec0d18316c5f904", "ja": "わあ～。ナイス普通な感想です♪　うんうん。\nやっぱり夏のお散歩スタイルは、これで決まりですね♪", "zh": "哇～。非常普通而中肯的感想呢♪　嗯嗯。\n果然夏天的散步穿搭，就这么定啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "b71d51fe2e92e093931fc5687469345528dfc2d569356bd9243ea8360c43c0b5", "ja": "今日は偶然、{$P$}さんにも\n出会えて、とってもラッキーです！", "zh": "今天偶然还遇到了{$P$}先生，真是太幸运了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5bd0b013931db5f4bea6db91d6cc45fe718d5f01a7dcf471a3cfa945a2bee466", "ja": "これは偶然じゃなくて……いや、何でもない。\nそうか。麗花にとってはラッキーだったのか。", "zh": "这并不是偶然……不，没什么。这样啊，对丽花来说是幸运的一天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "553c93284d6433fd94c6ef94b280fae87e2bda1ff758418fda6adbe37bfcf242", "ja": "はい♪　お気に入りの服を見つけて、お散歩が楽しくて\n私のお願い事も叶って……ラッキーな一日です♪", "zh": "是呀♪ 找到了喜欢的衣服，散步也很开心，我的愿望也实现了……真是幸运的一天♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1012_p", "source_sha256": "377e16db5f5aa305b3786502ef45cb6acce37d063b5fea0c96f3e55e9d1344e3", "ja": "お願い事？", "zh": "愿望？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "7d64e1c190e4c080807a99060108251cdda131a14509cc2f2f05dc01ed1dbaaf", "ja": "ふふっ。それはナイショです♪", "zh": "呵呵，这是秘密哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8ec0c5ad8943e1b8c8451b5e3480be9e88fb988802dbfa5e1a9eaa288b7e3960", "ja": "そ、そうか……。俺もいつもと違う麗花の姿が見られて\nラッキーだよ。まあ、麗花のお零れかもしれないけど。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……我也很幸运，能看到和平时不一样的丽花。嘛，说不定只是沾了丽花的光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "fd6a440c04276ac405ba518936621975be43f3cc4b40d5d296ed62a974f3594c", "ja": "お零れじゃなくて、運命かもしれませんよ？\nだって、今日のお散歩で会いたかったのは……。", "zh": "也许不是沾光，而是命运呢？\n因为今天散步时我想见的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1016_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "90f908299eacdafefe40593f0213b34c1108334f50475b2b8d7f4d6dc8ca0ff7", "ja": "なんでもありません。私、この後もお散歩するんです\nけど、{$P$}さんはどうしますか？", "zh": "没什么。我接下来还要继续散步，{$P$}先生呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c9da6c7a8f35e829df8a79546e11e93aface3a72175cb219bb060a425e7316db", "ja": "あ、えっと……折角のお誘いだけど、ごめん。\n仕事が残ってて、ちょっと難しいかな。", "zh": "啊，那个……难得你邀请我，不过，抱歉。\n我还有工作没做完，恐怕有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "0132112412ca2aff92437a67cd1bcfc20d45dd7c4fcedf0ff9a1dedfde7a6fd3", "ja": "そうですか……。\nちょっぴり残念ですけど、お仕事は大事ですもんね。", "zh": "这样啊……\n虽然有一点遗憾，不过工作也很重要嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "7299498b7530e39d3d3f647177c7413a9db10b54ccc0490ede7593c78bfd48b2", "ja": "私、お散歩しながら応援します！\nフレー、フレーって！", "zh": "我会一边散步一边给你加油的！\n加油，加油——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1021_p", "source_sha256": "54e50c559c9ae5379e4be41b2739daf24060247cc52d1ad3e8980820e20625ed", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。でも歩きながら何かをするのは\n危険だから、気持ちだけ受け取っておくよ。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。不过边走边做什么很危险，\n所以你的心意我收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7d7d945f0469757e9d607f1758566fcb67db4d4566c69af1d50143a2509abbd8", "ja": "……そうだ！　もし時間があるなら\n控え室に行ってみたらどうだ。みんなも喜ぶと思うよ。", "zh": "……对了！如果你有时间的话，要不要去休息室看看？大家应该也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "0d5cff93c94b47d2dfab88251952046f1353d1cdfa845b4578cf6cb9401fa93c", "ja": "いいんですか？　わーいわーい！\nラッキーな出来事が、またひとつ増えちゃいました。", "zh": "可以吗？太棒啦太棒啦！\n幸运的事又多了一件呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_048rei0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_048rei0464_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "e8f0faa105261d85608655f20e5d81efd2fc301dc81159c4131978cf1178f1a1", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}さん！\n私と一緒に、控え室までレッツゴ～！　えへへ♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生！\n和我一起去休息室吧～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
